    {
      "id": "b322771d22eb30baffe205235d2ddc79fa99b56d",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2472190649,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> Unfortunately, I'm not sure you can mark a #define as deprecated, so that you'll get compile-time warnings\n\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/a/33686251\nhas a solution for GCC using its pragmas, but I am not sure it's worth going to the trouble.",
